ild to participate freely and safely in physical activities; and (F) A plan to ensure physical activity occurs on days when extreme weather conditions prohibit or limit outdoor play.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026350507","violation_type_title":"Written Operational Policies - Promotion of Physical Activity (26 TAC §746.501(a)(18))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-202912-i20221117-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1311-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-202912-i20221117","date":"2022-11-17","original_code":"746.1311(a)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-12-01","finding":"Director Annual Training 30 Hours Required: One of the directors lacked documentation of  completion of 18 clock hours training to complete last years annual training.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026430686","violation_type_title":"Director Annual Training 30 Hours Required (26 TAC §746.1311(a))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-202912-i20221003","date":"2022-10-03","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905766513","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905766513","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-10-03","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-202912-i20220922","date":"2022-09-22","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":2,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905766512","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905766512","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-09-22","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-202